{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-4-11","kind":"proposition","title":"圆内接正五边形的尺规作图","englishTitle":"In a given circle to inscribe an equilateral and equiangular pentagon.","book":4,"number":11,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":11,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-4-11@raw-a55bba8ebfdb7a94","contentId":"euclid-4-11","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a55bba8ebfdb7a948f4f79eb21f18e9cd167dfefa9dbfc282406a6ccbfbc663b","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-4-11.statement","euclid-4-11.construction.1","euclid-4-11.construction.2","euclid-4-11.proof.1","euclid-4-11.proof.2","euclid-4-11.proof.3","euclid-4-11.proof.4","euclid-4-11.proof.5","euclid-4-11.proof.6","euclid-4-11.proof.7","euclid-4-11.proof.8","euclid-4-11.conclusion","euclid-4-11.historical.1","euclid-4-11.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-4-11.statement","contentId":"euclid-4-11","revisionId":"euclid-4-11@raw-a55bba8ebfdb7a94","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c8b7226d90774980b78d75c08d0a9e53f680718c450aa71042053fa9ec47d7ff","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In a given circle to inscribe an equilateral and equiangular pentagon."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在给定的圆中输入一个等边和等角的五角形。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有圜求作圜内五边切形其形等边等角"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果有一个圆，在圆内画一个内切五边形，其形状为等边等角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-11.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-4-11","revisionId":"euclid-4-11@raw-a55bba8ebfdb7a94","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d3d8220a98ace44fb38f0184a2c59bf86119957dfd73ad8a854e69f9d2b042a3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCDE be the given circle; thus it is required to inscribe in the circle ABCDE an equilateral and equiangular pentagon."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABCDE成为给定的圆; 因此, 必须在圆内加入一个等边和等角的五角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-11.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-4-11","revisionId":"euclid-4-11@raw-a55bba8ebfdb7a94","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1d4f7eddf45d5d3b165113710daecab86ba97cf0a0f81ec0d0f9357847709a70","citations":["euclid-4-10","euclid-4-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the isosceles triangle FGH be set out having each of the angles at G, H double of the angle at F; [[IV. 10](/principles/euclid-4-10)] let there be inscribed in the circle ABCDE the triangle ACD equiangular with the triangle FGH, so that the angle CAD is equal to the angle at F and the angles at G, H respectively equal to the angles ACD, CDA; [[IV. 2](/principles/euclid-4-2)] therefore each of the angles ACD, CDA is also double of the angle CAD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将等腰三角形 FGH FGH 的角各为G, H 角度的两倍, F ; 在ABCDE 圆上标出三角ACD 等角, 三角FGH , 角CAD 等于角 G, 角等于角 ACD, CDA ; 因此, 角中每个角 ACD, CDA 也等于角 CAD 的一倍。 [[IV. 10](/principles/euclid-4-10)] [[IV. 2](/principles/euclid-4-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-11.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-4-11","revisionId":"euclid-4-11@raw-a55bba8ebfdb7a94","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f50fe672f5630d898fea330beb8cccc1b8fc7af68baaada4822279b11cb6ca07","citations":["euclid-1-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now let the angles ACD, CDA be bisected respectively by the straight lines CE, DB [[I. 9](/principles/euclid-1-9)], and let AB, BC, DE, EA be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,ACD,CDA这个角度分别由CE,DB直线两部分分割,AB,BC,DE,EA连接。 [[I. 9](/principles/euclid-1-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-11.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-4-11","revisionId":"euclid-4-11@raw-a55bba8ebfdb7a94","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8149537b4354130c59772979f28cab91ab174a1e74b925a2a0ed6f88b31cff74","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since each of the angles ACD, CDA is double of the angle CAD, and they have been bisected by the straight lines CE, DB, therefore the five angles DAC, ACE, ECD, CDB, BDA are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ACD角的每个角都是CAD角的两倍, 被CE线和DB线分了两部分, 因此,5号角的DAC,ACE,ECD,CDB,BDA是等同的。（相关点与线段：CDA）"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-11.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-4-11","revisionId":"euclid-4-11@raw-a55bba8ebfdb7a94","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"63808c337ec61e31fdbfcc404d74d8956b31949ec0b0019aebcc56bf98ef3dd1","citations":["euclid-3-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But equal angles stand on equal circumferences; [[III. 26](/principles/euclid-3-26)] therefore the five circumferences AB, BC, CD, DE, EA are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但角对角是相同的;因此,五圈AB、BC、CD、DE、EA是等同的。 [[III. 26](/principles/euclid-3-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-11.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-4-11","revisionId":"euclid-4-11@raw-a55bba8ebfdb7a94","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d6a3c8513311a50394b5922a004179aa5ebc6765af034901dcf946f1a8e9281f","citations":["euclid-3-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But equal circumferences are subtended by equal straight lines; [[III. 29](/principles/euclid-3-29)] therefore the five straight lines AB, BC, CD, DE, EA are equal to one another; therefore the pentagon ABCDE is equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但相同的环形线由等直线组成;因此,五条直线AB、BC、CD、DE、EA是等直线;因此,五边形ABCDE是等直线。 [[III. 29](/principles/euclid-3-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-11.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-4-11","revisionId":"euclid-4-11@raw-a55bba8ebfdb7a94","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aff5930db734ec5c20ca44a9f9dc8e5a0d9500bfd5fb27e77abd4865b141557c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also equiangular."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,它也是角形的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-11.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-4-11","revisionId":"euclid-4-11@raw-a55bba8ebfdb7a94","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"14f841e088e5c63a14b9b408436ad8575f935b80309caadab7a25c79cd86afd3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the circumference AB is equal to the circumference DE, let BCD be added to each; therefore the whole circumference ABCD is equal to the whole circumference EDCB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为环形AB等于环形DE, 每人加BCD;因此整个环形ABCD等于整个环形EDCB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-11.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-4-11","revisionId":"euclid-4-11@raw-a55bba8ebfdb7a94","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2b1fd89df02fafef52ee3373a62b5b236ffab7c4ed15ec1fc4dd210269a6e412","citations":["euclid-3-27"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the angle AED stands on the circumference ABCD, and the angle BAE on the circumference EDCB; therefore the angle BAE is also equal to the angle AED. [[III. 27](/principles/euclid-3-27)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"角度AED在环形ABCD上,角度BAE在环形EDCB上,因此角度BAE也等于角度AED。 [[III. 27](/principles/euclid-3-27)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-11.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-4-11","revisionId":"euclid-4-11@raw-a55bba8ebfdb7a94","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0eaa0a0b2e5de6271c674de85a378a43fb4ea3bff6c2c87f0ef97cc3d385cc45","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason each of the angles ABC, BCD, CDE is also equal to each of the angles BAE, AED; therefore the pentagon ABCDE is equiangular."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,ABC、BCD、CDE等角度的每一个角度也与BAE、AED等角度的每一个角度相同;因此,五角ABCDE是等角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-11.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-4-11","revisionId":"euclid-4-11@raw-a55bba8ebfdb7a94","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5bd186c02c2829c9c2b909fdc2fe04800f5d94d92e601b7df27e9d21fa83ac4f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was also proved equilateral; therefore in the given circle an equilateral and equiangular pentagon has been inscribed. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但事实证明,它也是等边的;因此,在给定的圆圈中,已经记录了等边和等角的五角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-11.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-4-11","revisionId":"euclid-4-11@raw-a55bba8ebfdb7a94","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"11cb7fb7766a45b73e6d05a431f5549f58db61b931e6557524e071e5cad79d15","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有圜求作圜内五边切形其形等边等角法曰甲乙丙丁戊圜求作五边内切圜形等边等角先作己庚辛两边等角形而庚辛两角各倍大于己角〈本篇十〉次于圜内作甲丙丁角形与己庚辛角形各等角〈本篇二〉次以甲丙丁甲丁丙两角各两平分〈一卷九〉作丙戊丁乙两线末作甲乙乙丙丙丁丁戊戊甲五线相联即甲乙丙丁戊为五边内切圜形而五边五角俱自相等论曰甲丙丁甲丁丙两角皆倍大于丙甲丁角而两角又平分即甲丁乙乙丁丙丙甲丁丁丙戊戊丙甲五角皆等而五角所乘之甲乙乙丙丙丁丁戊戊甲五圜分亦等〈三卷廿六〉即甲乙乙丙丙丁丁戊戊甲五线亦等〈三卷廿九〉是五边形之五边等又甲乙戊丁两圜分等而各加一乙丙丁圜分即甲乙丙丁与戊丁丙乙两圜分等乘两圜分之甲戊丁乙甲戊两角亦等依显馀三角与两角俱等是五边形之五角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果有一个圆，在圆内画一个五边形内切于圆。构造等边等角的方法如下：甲乙丙丁戊 找到五边形内切圆，首先在两侧画 己庚辛 等腰三角形，并且 庚辛 有两个角大于 己，然后绘制三角形 和 己庚辛 具有相等角的三角形 〈本篇二〉。接下来，使用 甲丙丁甲丁丙 平分 和 丙戊丁乙 的两个角，最后得出 甲乙乙丙丙丁丁戊戊甲。连接五条线，即 甲乙丙丁戊 是一个五边形内切圆，五边和五角都相等。证明如下：甲丙丁甲丁丙 两个角是 丙甲丁 的两倍，并且两个角被平分，所以 甲丁乙乙丁丙丙甲丁丁丙戊戊丙甲 五个角都相等，五个弧乘以五个角也相等 甲乙乙丙丙丁丁戊戊甲 〈三卷廿六〉 是 甲乙乙丙丙丁丁戊戊甲 五条线也相等；〈三卷廿九〉 是五边形的五条等边，甲乙戊丁 两个弧相等且每个相等的一条 乙丙丁 弧 甲乙丙丁 和 戊丁丙乙 由两条弧相等。甲戊丁乙甲戊 观察剩余三角形，两个角也相等，两个角相等，这就是五边形的五边形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-11.source","contentId":"euclid-4-11","revisionId":"euclid-4-11@raw-a55bba8ebfdb7a94","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"20da7a473187155805ea24e6f1e466d4c530d03918d0b5c4fe9e5ad2775a2004","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-4-10:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-11.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-4-10","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"IV. 10"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-4-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-11.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-4-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"IV. 2"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-1-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-11.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-9","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"I. 9"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-3-26:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-11.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-26","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"III. 26"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-3-29:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-11.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-29","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"III. 29"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-3-27:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-11.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-27","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.11/","sourceLabel":"III. 27"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-4-12:euclid-4-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-12","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-12.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-4-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.12","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.12/","sourceLabel":"IV. 11"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-4-10:explicit","id":"euclid-4-10","book":4,"number":10,"kind":"proposition","title":"黄金三角形的尺规构造","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-4-2:explicit","id":"euclid-4-2","book":4,"number":2,"kind":"proposition","title":"在圆内作与给定三角形相似的三角形","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-1-9:explicit","id":"euclid-1-9","book":1,"number":9,"kind":"proposition","title":"角平分线的尺规作图","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-3-26:explicit","id":"euclid-3-26","book":3,"number":26,"kind":"proposition","title":"等圆之乘圆分角或在心或在界等其所乘之圆分亦等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-3-29:explicit","id":"euclid-3-29","book":3,"number":29,"kind":"proposition","title":"等圆之圆分等则其割圆分之直线亦等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-11:euclid-3-27:explicit","id":"euclid-3-27","book":3,"number":27,"kind":"proposition","title":"等圆之角所乘圆分等则其角或在心或在界俱等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-12:euclid-4-11:explicit","id":"euclid-4-12","book":4,"number":12,"kind":"proposition","title":"有圆求作圆外五边切形其形等边等角","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-polygon","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
